 
==============================================================================
 SWAC1  (acceso Docentes - DOC1)
==============================================================================
 
enable
configure terminal
vtp domain ITLA
vtp mode client
 
interface range e0/0 - 1
 switchport trunk encapsulation dot1q
 switchport mode trunk
 no shutdown
 exit
 
interface e1/0
 switchport mode access
 switchport access vlan 20
 spanning-tree portfast
 no shutdown
 exit
 
end
write memory
